
CTRYTEST - the country block a number is formatted with

  1 38h answers                        ok
      00 00 24 00 00 00 00 2C 00 2E 00 2D 00 3A 00 00 02 00 D0 02 00 04 2C 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 
  2 thousands separator is a string   ','  ok
  3 decimal, date, time, list         '.' '-' ':' ','  ok
  4 and the country code in BX        0001 ok
  5 the case map can be CALLED        0400:02D0 a ok
  6 65h/01h says the same thing       01','  ok

CTRYTEST done.
